From: Synkar <dev@synkar.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bcmdhd: port Rockchip vendor driver 6.1 -> 6.18 for AP6275P/BCM43752 (WiFi6)

Port the rkwifi bcmdhd driver (101.10.591.x, kernel-6.1 SDK) to kernel
6.18 for out-of-tree build against OpenWrt mac80211 backports headers.
Enables 802.11ax (HE) on AP6275P PCIe, which mainline brcmfmac lacks.

Compat: linuxver.h (lib80211/MODULE_IMPORT_NS/timer_delete), unaligned.h
(6.17), RPS stub (6.9), kstat_irqs percpu (6.18), cfg80211 radio_idx
wrappers + ch_switch_notify (6.17/6.18), out-of-tree -I fix, dhd_gpio with
weak rockchip_wifi_* stubs, MRRS=128 quirk, cfg80211 parent = PCI device,
SYNDBG/SYNDBG2 debug prints.

---
